\newlabel{fig:synthesis_panels}{{7}{7}{\textbf {Left:} Instruction-dominant heads across all 32 layers (L1, L31 entry-exit for VLA-trained; L16 peak for Llama-2 base; zero for random). \textbf {Right:} Dose-response ablation (progressively masking instruction-dominant heads); divergence rises through 12 heads then plateaus. 95\% bootstrap CIs}{figure.7}{}}
